      "message": "Merge #993 (issue/842-band-stack-drill-probe) into #1015: stack on it\n\nBoth change the cross-drill laws' call lines in operation/cross_spindle.rs:\n#993 passes the body-carrying cutter (cross_holder's band stack, part_clear's\ncutter), this branch maps each refusal's ghost back to the world. Kept both\non every line: #993's new arguments with this branch's map_err.\n\nRefs #1015\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
