      "message": "test(app): the multiaxis-rough shank refusal now arrives with its ghost\n\n#1015 gave the 5-axis stamp shank refusal a ghost, so GenerateOperation\nreturns CommandError::MachiningGhost, which reads as Machining. The test\nmatched Machining only; it now accepts the Machining family and pins that\nthe ghost is carried.\n\nRefs #1015\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
